\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Hark, 'tis the watchman's cry:
\par Wake, brethren, wake!
\par Jesus Himself is nigh;
\par Wake, brethren, wake!
\par Sleep is for sons of night;
\par Ye are children of the light;
\par Yours is the glory bright;
\par Wake, brethren, wake!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Call to each wakening band:
\par Watch, brethren, watch!
\par Clear is our Lord's command:
\par Watch, brethren, watch!
\par Be ye as men that wait
\par Always at their Master's gate,
\par E'en though He tarry late;
\par Watch, brethren, watch!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Heed we the Master's call:
\par Work, brethren, work!
\par There's room enough for all,
\par Work, brethren, work!
\par This vineyard of the Lord
\par Constant labour will afford;
\par He will your work reward:
\par Work, brethren, work!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Hear we the Saviour's voice:
\par Pray, brethren, pray!
\par Would ye His heart rejoice,
\par Pray, brethren, pray!
\par Sin calls for ceaseless fear,
\par Weakness needs the Strong One near;
\par Long as ye struggle here,
\par Pray, brethren, pray!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Sound now the final chord,
\par Praise, brethren, praise!
\par Thrice holy is the Lord,
\par Praise, brethren, praise!
\par What more befits the tongues
\par Soon to join the angels' songs?
\par Whilst heaven the note prolongs,
\par Praise, brethren, praise!
\par 
\par \f1 
